          <div class="small" data-i18n="imm.duration.n">per session</div>
        </div>
        <hr class="preg-rule">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="big" data-i18n="imm.weekly.cost.v">15 €</div>
          <div class="small" data-i18n="preg.summary.cost.n">per session (billed monthly)</div>
        </div>
        <hr class="preg-rule">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="big" data-i18n="preg.summary.where.t">In Albi</div>
          <div class="small" data-i18n="preg.summary.where.d">At Uma’s Books &amp; Adventures</div>
        </div>
        <hr class="preg-rule">
        <p class="blurb" data-i18n="preg.summary.blurb">A welcoming, community-led program where children and adults explore English through books, stories and creative activities.</p>
